      "final_text": "美国市场：美国股票上涨（标普500指数 +0.3%，纳斯达克指数 +0.7%），人工智能(AI)相关板块出现反弹。投资者斯坦利·德鲁肯米勒(Stanley Druckenmiller)发表文章批评财政部回购计划。市场关注度集中于此，国债收益率沿收益率曲线全线下行（2年期 -5至4.18%，10年期 -8至4.63%，30年期 -7至5.16%）。美元指数下跌 -0.1%，黄金上涨0.1%，布伦特原油下跌 -2.7%。在美国对价值200亿美元的加拿大商品实施关税后，加拿大宣布对数百种美国产品征收最高50%的报复性关税，涉及金额达200亿美元，约占加拿大自美进口商品的6%。",
      "iterations": 1,
      "seg_status": "edited",
      "source_text": "U.S. markets: US equities gained (S&P 500 +0.3%, Nasdaq +0.7%) with a bounce in AI-related sectors. Treasury yields fell across the curve (2Y -5bps to 4.18%, 10Y -8bps to 4.63%, 30Y -7bps to 5.16%) as markets focused on a paper from investor Stanley Druckenmiller criticizing the Treasury’s buyback plans. The dollar index fell -0.1%, gold gained 0.1%, Brent crude fell -2.7%. Following US tariffs implemented on $20B of Canadian goods, Canada announced up to 50% of retaliatory tariffs on hundreds of US products $20B, covering about 6% of Canada’s goods imports from the US.",
